[[0,1294932,0,46,1,45,"2016-09-18T20:42:04","SilverBanana","",[],"","'Modesty' by Antonio Corradini, 1752","http://i.imgtc.com/6EXkEE3.jpg","pics"],[1,6351066,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-18T20:42:27","SilverBanana","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://www.museosansevero.it/en/statues-and-anatomical-machines/statues-of-the-virtues/modesty\">Info</a></p>"],[1,6352400,0,3,0,3,"2016-09-18T23:29:03","lol_lol","",[],"<p>I like the statues that you post. Keep doing this. I love this form of art.</p>"],[1,6353288,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-19T01:29:53","dontforgetaboutevil","",[],"<p>Now that is the image of a fecund woman.</p>"],[1,6353574,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-19T02:09:02","TheNerdyCowboy","",[],"<p>That is quite a nice angle on the piece.</p>"],[1,6353626,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-19T02:17:43","Luke_Luck","",[],"<p>Absolutely stunning.</p>"],[1,6355625,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-19T10:34:40","Link1299","[e]",[],"<p>I have had a resugence in personal artistry</p>\n<p>and while I will never claim to reach the quality of Da Vinci or Van Gough</p>\n<p>I certainly understand if I'm going to be an artist worth my salt, I need to strive for expression in excellence</p>\n<p>not just expression alone</p>"],[2,6356107,6355625,1,0,1,"2016-09-19T12:29:43","SilverBanana","",[],"<p>Some of the basic stuff, like composition, perspective or accurate representation of shapes need constant training. Too many artist hide the imperfection behind abstraction or stylization. </p>\n<p>Anyway, be sure to submit your work to <a href=\"/v/pics\">/v/pics</a>!</p>"],[1,6355932,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-19T11:52:43","Antipodes","",[],"<p>Have weirdest boner right now.</p>"],[2,6356108,6355932,1,0,1,"2016-09-19T12:30:17","SilverBanana","",[],"<p>Not bad for 400 year old statue in a church. </p>"]]
